{"articleNo":"424506","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=424506&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 2022학년도 학생창업자 지원 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.02.12","hit":"2768","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">안녕하세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">산학협력단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(LINC3.0</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">사업단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">지원으로 창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">에서 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 14pt;\">들의 창업 활성화를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">위하여&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>2022</b></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>년도 학생 창업자들에 대한 창업지원비 지원</b>하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">상세 내용은 아래와 같습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">지 원 대 상  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0.0pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">:</span> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼둥근헤드라인; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">22.03.01. ~ 23.02.28 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">기간에 창업</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">한(사업자 등록)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;font-weight:bold;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">재학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;mso-text-raise:0.0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#0000ff;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">※</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">미 창업자 중 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">23.02.28</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">일까지 <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 116, 28);\">창업 예정자</span></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">→ </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">창업교육센터<font face=\"휴먼명조\">)</font></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">로 연락 시 상세한 절차를 안내하고 지원 할 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.3pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">제 출 서 류  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">사업자등록증 사본 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">부</span> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">접 수 기 한  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><b>2023. 02. 28.</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">제 출 방 법  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">방문 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">벤처창업관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">313</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">호</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">이메일 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">(startup@kumoh.ac.kr)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">■<font face=\"휴먼명조\">&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">지 원 내 용  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">500,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">원 상당의 상품권</span></b></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">위의 지원대상에 충족하는 학생이 있다면 사업자등록증을 창업교육센터에 제출 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">   </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">▶ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">해당 사항 확인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">500,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">원 상당의 상품권 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">상품권의 경우 생활협동조합 상품권 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">만원권 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">50</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">장으로 지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">실물 상품권 구매 후 제공까지 조금의 시간이 걸릴 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">문의 및 연락처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">: 054-478-7897~8, startup@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
